---
id: icecap-deal-summary-v1
description: Analyzes a property listing and returns a structured investment summary, red flags, and recommendation
model: gemini-2.0-flash-lite
config:
  temperature: 0.5
input:
  schema:
    address: string
    price: string
    estimatedRent: string
    description: string
---
Analyze this real estate listing description for an investor.

PROPERTY DATA:
Address: {{address}}
Price: ${{price}}
Estimated Rent: ${{estimatedRent}}

DESCRIPTION:
{{description}}

Provide:
1. A one-paragraph investment summary.
2. A list of 3 specific red flags (if any).
3. A final recommendation.

Format as:
SUMMARY: [text]
RED FLAGS:
- [flag 1]
- [flag 2]
- [flag 3]
RECOMMENDATION: [text]
